Cell["A window of symbols that no rule matches is left unchanged.", "Notes",
 CellID->372149905,ExpressionUUID->"69cbed9b-e5ca-40f2-bcbf-8f7d53235837"],

Cell["\<\
To be compiled, every step must replace its window by the same number of \
symbols, all the rules of a step must have left-hand sides of the same \
length, and offsets must not be negative.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->219445347,ExpressionUUID->"e4233dc8-9801-4677-87dc-ecc3c5fc6fe8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ring machine uses the symbols from 0 to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "9e5dbe43-b881-4fa3-a8f3-d8e244dfffca"],
 "-1, where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "543c8c9e-1a82-4a95-af27-84693969f6c3"],
 " is the largest of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["tapeStates", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "20a6e4cf-d49a-45e0-8bf5-fcc8bbcd2890"],
 " and one more than the largest symbol written explicitly in the rules. \
Symbols computed by a right-hand side such as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["Mod"]], "paclet:ref/Mod"},
    "RefLink",
    BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "45876100-f8f3-4123-b705-f88b4a7c5781"],
 " are not counted, so give ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["tapeStates", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c041e969-b355-4fb7-be35-d7db82d30b91"],
 " for rules like that. The default value of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["tapeStates", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4ff05f1f-5cb6-4af4-8438-24a858bd97e5"],
 " is 2."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->47645954,ExpressionUUID->"f1b9e9d9-c180-43c2-8f7b-8a863a6c727d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "20f02af9-a861-452f-ab76-233e8c6e640c"],
 "-ary cyclic tag tape is the ring machine tape itself, so the ring machine's \
initial condition needs no conversion. The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "aec6432e-9f03-455b-b06e-21478b76e5ea"],
 "-ary system uses one more symbol, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "14c7de21-f6bd-4c05-ad0c-dacda9d8657a"],
 ", as a marker."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->819719427,ExpressionUUID->"a5c43ce5-6cea-4457-94d4-cb3c9dde7514"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each ring machine step becomes a sequence of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "36f8de93-a7fe-4954-9f3e-8a5ab1480891"],
 "-ary rule parts. All but the last of them read the window one symbol at a \
time, turning each symbol into a delay: its value times a power of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "80807d38-717c-42be-a18a-930434607cf3"],
 ". A symbol 0 adds no delay. The total delay picks out a group of \
appendants, and the last symbol of the window is appended to the tape as \
itself and picks the appendant within that group, so the tape symbols do the \
final selection and no second marker symbol is needed. Then the system skips \
around the rest of the tape, uses those two selections to reach the appendant \
that writes the replacement, and skips on to where the next step starts."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->272569159,ExpressionUUID->"e6e228b3-daed-4ea7-b197-54606ccd662f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The compiled rule only works for tapes of length ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["tapeLength", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c974138c-bffd-45c9-b8b3-03314dd5cd2b"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->788223192,ExpressionUUID->"f129ee52-9d09-4149-8421-9697948688e2"],

